  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effective Results  Framework - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall objective: to contribute to the enhancement of results-based practices and frameworks of countries and providers of development co-operation, with initial emphasis on contexts where the EU, its Member States and other major providers are active.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specific Objective: to enhance the quality of co-operation by supporting and promoting the use of common results frameworks and approaches as the collective anchor for action &#xbf; from analysis to planning, implementation, monitoring, evaluation, reporting, communication, and learning&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
